Next
----
Build the separate external evidence discovery layer.

The target use case is a query such as:

"Arthritis prevalence in India"

EviTrack should eventually discover relevant external evidence such as
research papers, official reports and datasets, show their source links and
metadata, and allow the user to select and curate evidence before it can
support a BIA input.

The external discovery layer should not replace the existing guideline
retrieval system and should not modify the deterministic BIA engine.
